<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 60px' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 44, background: '#3B82F6', borderRadius: 3, marginRight: 16 }} />
    <Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>备份中心与配置管理</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 4 }}>第四章 · 数据·备份·日志</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 500, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 620, justifyContent: 'center', background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 16, padding: 16 }}>
      <svg width={590} height={468} viewBox='0 0 590 468'>
        <rect x='20' y='20' width='250' height='110' rx='12' fill='#EFF6FF' stroke='#3B82F6' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='145' y='58' textAnchor='middle' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold' fill='#0F172A'>☁ 每日自动备份</text>
        <text x='145' y='84' textAnchor='middle' fontSize='12' fill='#334155'>设置 + 更新历史打包为 JSON</text>
        <text x='145' y='106' textAnchor='middle' fontSize='12' fill='#334155'>存至 文档/HermesUpdater-Backups</text>
        <rect x='320' y='20' width='250' height='110' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#F59E0B' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='445' y='52' textAnchor='middle' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold' fill='#92400E'>🗓 保留策略</text>
        <text x='445' y='78' textAnchor='middle' fontSize='12' fill='#334155'>保留 1–30 份（默认 5）</text>
        <text x='445' y='100' textAnchor='middle' fontSize='12' fill='#334155'>超过自动清理最旧备份</text>
        <line x1='270' y1='75' x2='320' y2='75' stroke='#94A3B8' strokeWidth='2' />
        <polygon points='316,69 326,75 316,81' fill='#94A3B8' />
        <rect x='20' y='170' width='550' height='80' rx='12' fill='#0F172A' />
        <text x='295' y='202' textAnchor='middle' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold' fill='#FFFFFF'>备份中心：一键打开备份目录 · 从最新备份一键恢复</text>
        <text x='295' y='228' textAnchor='middle' fontSize='12' fill='#94A3B8'>自动兼容 OneDrive 重定向的文档目录，写入/恢复/打开三端一致</text>
        <line x1='145' y1='130' x2='145' y2='170' stroke='#94A3B8' strokeWidth='2' />
        <line x1='445' y1='130' x2='445' y2='170' stroke='#94A3B8' strokeWidth='2' />
        <rect x='20' y='290' width='265' height='150' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='40' y='322' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold' fill='#0F172A'>⇄ 设置导入 / 导出</text>
        <text x='40' y='350' fontSize='12' fill='#334155'>全部设置 + 历史打包为 JSON 文件，</text>
        <text x='40' y='372' fontSize='12' fill='#334155'>换机迁移、多机同步一份文件搞定；</text>
        <text x='40' y='394' fontSize='12' fill='#334155'>导出时代理密码自动脱敏为 ***，</text>
        <text x='40' y='416' fontSize='12' fill='#334155'>防止凭据泄露</text>
        <rect x='305' y='290' width='265' height='150' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#8B5CF6' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='325' y='322' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold' fill='#5B21B6'>📋 配置方案 Profiles</text>
        <text x='325' y='350' fontSize='12' fill='#334155'>把「安装路径 + 分支 + 网络方式 +</text>
        <text x='325' y='372' fontSize='12' fill='#334155'>镜像 + 代理」存成命名方案，</text>
        <text x='325' y='394' fontSize='12' fill='#334155'>多环境场景一键整切，</text>
        <text x='325' y='416' fontSize='12' fill='#334155'>不用逐项改设置</text>
      </svg>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        配置也是数据。<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>每天一份快照 + 随时可导出</span>，误改设置、换电脑、重装系统都有退路。
      </Text>
      {[
        ['database', '#3B82F6', '端到端验证', '备份 → 恢复全链路实测通过，恢复后设置立即生效并刷新界面'],
        ['shield', '#10B981', '隐私安全', '代理凭据导出/备份双重脱敏，日志同样不落敏感信息'],
      ].map(([ic, c, t, d]) => (
        <Box key={t} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 46, height: 46, borderRadius: 12, background: '#F1F5F9', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <FAIcon name={ic} style={{ fill: c, width: 24, height: 24 }} />
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>{t}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 3 }}>{d}</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      ))}
      <Box style={{ background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 18px', borderLeft: '4px solid #3B82F6' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1D4ED8', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          日志系统：运行日志 5 秒自动刷新、级别着色、关键词搜索 + <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>错误/警告级别过滤</span>，排查问题一步到位
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>HermesUpdater · 功能全景</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>14 / 19</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
